Excited to co-found Discovery Loop with long-time collaborators @JeffDean, @Sanjay_Ghemawat, and @OriolVinyalsML. The mission is to automate machine learning, science, and engineering to accelerate discoveries and progress.

@JeffDean: "Announcing Discovery Loop! Along with @Sanjay_Ghemawat, @OriolVinyalsML, and @quocleix, we are founding Discovery Loop, a Public Benefit Corporation dedicated to automating science and engineering through AI. We have worked together for 14 to 30 years, helping build many of the world’s most used products, infrastructure, and AI models, and now we are pursuing this ambitious goal."

Discovery Loop is building AI systems that automate the experimental loops of science and engineering, focusing on continuous exploration.
